  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Rights Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support protection of key human rights by providing legal aid services to women in hard-to-reach areas, building civil society capacity to track civil and political rights and achieving greater recognition of issues of human rights in business. This will benefit over 30,000 women and 1,000 workers directly, and millions of ordinary citizens indirectly, through a nationwide tracking of civil and political rights in the build up to, during and after the 2015 elections, thereby reducing human rights abuses in the country. This will contribute towards the Millennium Development Goals by achieving more equitable growth and development in Tanzania by 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
